    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"help\" is the worst part. everyone just wants to \"fix\" it or wait for the storm to pass, but they don't get that there is no storm. the storm is what i am now. i can't go back to being that person. i try to imagine a future, a normal life, and i just see nothing. just a void. it feels like i'm just performing a role in a life that's already been cancelled.",
